    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d804">

                <pb facs="1018" n="1004" xml:id="pg1004"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">501.BC/7–3147: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Embassy in India </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">confidential</hi>
                        <lb/>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">u.s. urgent</hi>
                        <lb/>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">niact</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1947-07-31T20:00:00-04:00">July 31, 1947—8
                            p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>460. You may inform Nehru US Govt has noted India’s letter to UN Security
                    Council. US is urgently considering what measures might most appropriately be
                    taken to bring about cessation of hostilities and resumption of negotiations
                    looking toward a peaceful settlement Dutch and Indonesian differences.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Marshall</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
